# This snippet diverts the protected paths to the "anubis" service, which
# presents a proof-of-work challenge designed to stop simple bots and slow down
# advanced bots.
#
# Usage:
#
# - Copy this into the caddy-conf volume (modify @protected if desired, but
#   note that `/.within.website/*` is required for Anubis to function properly)
# - Copy bot-protection.server.caddyfile into the caddy-conf volume
# - Enable the "anubis" compose service
# - Restart the "web" service
#
# See docs/install/bot-protection.md for bot protection details.

@protected path /data/* /search/* /.within.website/*
handle @protected {
  reverse_proxy anubis:8080 {
    header_up X-Real-IP {client_ip}
  }
}
